      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Some more detail:\nThe image #1 shows my first order of expression parameter. My guess was, that some parameters somewhere in the middle will not be synced. So I changed the order like on image #2. With this, I have no issues anymore in open beta!\nSo, it look like something is wrong at an certain position. Maybe, it's only related to SDK. Or maybe also, there is some data loss during sync.",
