      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Ok, next step:\nI have added 256 boxes, 256 bool parameters and 256 animations to this funny robot from SDK. All parameters are set to true by default and are not saved. So, they must all be synced as true for the friends. But nope - only the first 32 bits and the last bit will be synced (Bit 0 is green, Bit 255 is red -> count from right to left because of the mirror).",
